    "body": "Refresh: merged `origin/main` into this branch (merge commit `6812c0c4e`). No rebase and no force-push.\n\nHand-resolved file (one):\n- `crates/app/tests/shared_face_bodies.rs`: PR #1772 changed the 3D Pocket test `the_sample_as_imported_roughs_the_3d_pocket_beside_its_silhouette` and its doc comment. The resolution takes the main side of that test and comment without change. The old 3D Finish test `the_sample_as_imported_still_generates_the_3d_finish` stays deleted, because this PR moved it to `shared_face_bodies_finish.rs`.\n\n`git diff origin/main -- crates/app/tests/shared_face_bodies.rs` now shows only the removal of the 3D Finish test and the two module-doc lines that point to the new file.\n\nTests (debug, default suite, on the merge head):\n- `shared_face_bodies`: 5 passed, 0 failed, 0 ignored.\n- `shared_face_bodies_finish`: 1 passed, 0 failed, 6 ignored (the six band tests are in the heavy lane).\n- `cargo clippy -p camcraft-app --tests -- -D warnings`: clean.\n- `cargo xtask gate release --dry-run`: lists `app heavy: shared_face_bodies_finish`.\n\nNot run: the six `--ignored` band tests in release (heavy lane, cut only), and no other suites. The PR stays a draft.\n",
